sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Reviewer
  participant A as App shell and state
  participant R as PR review
  participant G as GitHub client
  participant H as GitHub API
  U->>A: open PR number N
  A->>G: fetchPRComments (paginated)
  A->>G: fetchPRFileManifest (paginated)
  G->>H: pulls.listFiles and pulls.get
  H-->>G: changed files and base and head SHAs
  A->>G: fetchPRFile for the selected document
  G-->>R: base and head content
  R-->>U: rendered diff with comments
  U->>R: select text and queue line-anchored comments
  U->>R: submit review
  R->>G: submitReviewBatched
  G->>H: pulls.createReview
  alt a comment line does not resolve (422)
    G->>H: post comments one by one, then the review if an event or body was given
  end
  R->>G: refresh comments after the write and every 30 s
